      and <a href={repoFile("packages/httpeers-access/src/rules.ts")}>rules.ts</a>.
    </li>
    <li><a href={docHref("packages/webrun-biscuit/README.md")}>webrun-biscuit</a>: minting, attenuation, sealing, verification, Datalog.</li>
    <li><a href={docHref("packages/httpeers-hub/README.md")}>httpeers-hub</a>: invitations, the member registry, revocation.</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/architecture#headers">Architecture: the two headers</a> that carry the proven peer and the token.</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/security">Security model</a>: data crosses safely, code does not.</li>
  </ul>
</Docs>
